  "Correct Answer": "C",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "Only in $y=3x-2$ does each value of $x$ correspond to a unique value of $y$. In the other three relations, one value of $x$ (such as $x=1$) can correspond to two values of $y$.",
